cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GaitScope in teaching or research, please cite it as below, with the version you used."
type: software
title: GaitScope
abstract: >-
  An interactive lab, in the browser, for learning how movement-sensor signals are
  processed: record or load a walk from a phone's accelerometer, then filter it, look
  at its spectrum, and compare step detectors side by side.
authors:
  - family-names: Dianaty
    given-names: Soroush
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/soroushdty/gaitscope"
url: "https://soroushdianaty.com/gaitscope/"
keywords:
  - accelerometer
  - step detection
  - gait
  - signal processing
  - education
